nr0RsdHg&oe=6A92DB75"}, {"file_name": "MOS_Screenshot_05.png", "id": "736657509427199", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303116_736657512760532_3787353401354777260_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0S77PoVz7LEQ7kNvwE0PGbf&_nc_oc=Adp9xQfv7Ll_6aNnjkSrz-s1FjRgrFcdRFOQviWd-gna08OtMedwDqeNngl38rMjTD4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFXGXQKRdO2nlQc39TzWez6P6a9dgx94seNTDc8dadwwA&oe=6A92D3C8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "MOSVR_CoverArt_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "833311606052129", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820980_833311609385462_3071336568594115766_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0T3wmuD_r7EQ7kNvwHKBSl3&_nc_oc=Ado_AQjq5b1FWSUFeAyi-mOX6onU3ELHGGwgrC5R2ojYRWcApcD31aoYpCy1hZBsyy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEp-NuBJv2--Nlv3pQl9XVucr2qIG9JPZD8xCqlWPZBjQ&oe=6A92C434"}, "display_name": "Maid of Sker VR", "keywords": ["sker", "horror", "survival", "scary", "fps"], "long_description": "Brave the nightmares of the Quiet Ones. Do not panic\u2026don\u2019t even breathe!\n\nMaid of Sker VR is a first-person survival horror, set in a remote hotel with a gory and macabre history from Welsh folklore. Armed with only a defensive sound device, you\u2019ll utilise stealth tactics to avoid death amongst a cult of sound-based AI enemies.\n\nSet in 1898 and inspired by the haunting Welsh tale of Elisabeth Williams, this is a story of a family empire driven by torture, slavery, piracy and a supernatural mystery that suffocates the grounds of the hotel.\n\n", "short_description": "Maid of Sker VR is a first-person survival horror, set in a remote hotel with a gory and macabre history from Welsh folklore. Brave the nightmares of the Quiet Ones. Do not panic\u2026don\u2019t even breathe!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.walesinteractive.com/privac